# QA M5 (D-075 respawn hold, D-085 "a Gelse first reaches Resi where she
# stands still or swims"): the boat route after a checkpoint respawn. As
# wolfgangsee_checkpoint to the respawn on the lantern pontoon (2337,
# hold until 2397). Traundl A is inside the activation range at the
# respawn, so it wakes at once and runs ~125 frames ahead of its
# continuous-run phase, while B, C and Gelse #2 wake by the scroll as
# before. Resi walks to the pontoon's end, hops the bollard (133) and
# drops into the water, waits for A at its near end and boards it with a
# held jump-out (press 2932, lands 2968; the earlier A cycle reaches its
# far end with the raft beyond the right clamp). Gelse #2 (hunting from
# ~2925) closes in during the ride and first reaches her ~13 frames after
# A docks at its far end (3038): standing still she is stung at 3051. A
# standing jump pressed 3028-3042 stomps it (15-frame window, measured by
# shifting the press); this replay presses at 3036 (stomp 3072).
# Compare the continuous run (wolfgangsee_traundl): there it reaches her
# on the border raft with a >= 41-frame stomp window.
